            "review_title": "Review at Olivia Pizza",
            "review_text": "Oscardog16\nAdelaide, Australia3345 contributions\n0\nFollowed advice from an expat for delicious pizza.\nAug 2025 • Couples\nWe took a taxi to & from the Novotel (111, 000 VND return) to eat in. Apparently, you can use the grab app to order delivery, but we couldn’t find the entire pizza menu on the App. Between 2 adults we struggled to eat the large (35 cms) meat lovers not spicy. One of us found that the flavour of the chicken overpowered the pizza, the other liked it. The restaurant was clean, and service was quick and pleasant. We highly recommend this restaurant if you are craving pizza with a good crust and nice tomato base.\nRead more\nWritten August 26, 2025",
